From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Paslawski <chris@paslawski.me>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 21:40:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] codec2: support stateful startup and SPS visible dimensions

Use explicit unknown coded dimensions and defer CAPTURE setup until SOURCE_CHANGE when the driver requires parsed headers. Parse AVC/HEVC SPS display cropping separately from coded allocation dimensions, with bounds checks and parser regressions.

Origin: Local ThinkSmart View port
Source: https://github.com/LineageOS/android_external_v4l2_codec2
Base-commit: 6685af1c65467d0b550d7b904418f65059bc3cbb
Apply in filename order within this project.

---
